  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that the existing use of 1 Charter Crecent TW4 6AY as a House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) for up to six people (C4 use) was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe evidence provided is sufficient to prove that, on the balance of probability, the use of 1 Charter Crescent TW4 6AY as a House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) for up to six people (C4 use) began prior to the Article 4 Direction removing permitted development rights for a change of use from dwellinghouse (C3 use) to an HMO (C4 use) coming into effect on 4th September 2023.\r\n"
